      },
      {
        "id": "kerrigan",
        "name": "Kerrigan"
      },
      {
        "id": "maiev",
        "name": "Maiev"
      },
      {
        "id": "malfurion",
        "name": "Malfurion"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Blaze's well-rounded Ability set allows him to work in most team compositions and with most other Heroes, granted he is also picked for his anti-melee role. Oil Spill's Slowing effect is particularly useful for improving the uptime of Assassins, whereas most Heroes with skillshots will find Jet Propulsion a great way of setting up for accurate hits."
  },
