        "id": "valla",
        "name": "Valla"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Since Blaze relies on skillshots to deal damage and on the rather slow charge up of Jet Propulsion to initiate, he tends to struggle offensively against highly mobile Heroes. Furthermore, his large Health pool and limited mobility makes him particularly vulnerable to percentage-based damage."
  },
