      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Thanks to his great waveclear and good self-sustain, Blaze excels on Maps where it is possible to double-soak and does well on most Maps.\n\nBlaze can get a lot of value from his Abilities on Maps that feature static Objectives that force opponents to fight within a specific area or in enclosed spaces (such as Infernal Shrines).\n\nOn the contrary, Blaze does not excel at dueling, therefore he does not do well on Maps where there is a Capture Point to contest in the early game (so Braxis Holdout)."
  },
